{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は生駒と原宿を満喫してきたー\nのーんびーりぶーらぶーら"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/07/22/9794418/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"前から約束してたのよ。\n久しぶりに買い物できてよかった"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/07/22/9794418/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"生駒はロリータとかロックとか詳しい。\nお店たくさん教えてもらいました。\nゴスロリ興味あるから着たいよー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そんで私は古着屋さん教えました。\nいっぱい試着した！\nお気に入りも見つかったし\nカフェでのんびりしたし\n充実した一日だったよー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お店に行くたび店員さんに\n高一ですかって聞かれたよ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"色気ないのは仕方ないから\nこのままで頑張ろうと決意しました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"このふたりが次18歳とか、、\n18歳って"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/07/22/9794418/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"わらわら"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"..."},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/07/22/9794418/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/07/22/9794418/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"丸めがねが似合う生駒が羨ましい\n今日生駒が着てた顔いっぱいTシャツ\nきもかわきゃわたん\nやっぱ趣味合うわ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また行こうね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/07/22/9794418/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりちゃんがつれてってやるよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/07/22/9794418/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"←"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりか"}],"source":"archive"}